Multi-stage ML pipeline worker for the Pherb speech processing
orchestrator. Handles whisper transcription, pyannote diarization,
and wav2vec2 alignment stages via NATS subscriptions.

Spawns child processes (whisper-cli, curl) and monitors them via
kqueue for zero-CPU idle wait. Publishes completion events to
pherb.pipeline.completed for the consumer state machine.

Built with Zig using kqueue-based I/O. Runs on the host alongside
whisper-cli, audio models, and ML service endpoints.
